(3494: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: name%3A%20CI%0A%0A%23%20The%20JavaScript%20workflow%20runs%20first%3B%20the%20Rust%20workflow%20and%20the%20issue%20195%0A%23%20acceptance%20stages%20run%20only%20after%20every%20JavaScript%20job%20passes%2C%20and%20each%20Rust%0A%23%20acceptance%20stage%20runs%20only%20after%20its%20JavaScript%20counterpart.%20When%20a%0A%23%20JavaScript%20job%20fails%2C%20the%20jobs%20after%20it%20show%20as%20skipped%2C%20and%20the%20Full%0A%23%20Requirements%20Aggregate%20reports%20one%20gate%20error%20naming%20the%20failed%20JavaScript%0A%23%20jobs.%20js.yml%20and%20rust.yml%20keep%20their%20release%20and%20dispatch%20triggers%2C%20so%20a%0A%23%20release%20runs%20them%20standalone%3B%20here%20a%20release%20runs%20only%20the%20acceptance%0A%23%20release-delivery%20checkpoint.%20Every%20push%20and%20pull%20request%20runs%2C%20without%20path%0A%23%20filters%2C%20because%20Full%20Requirements%20Aggregate%20is%20a%20required%20check.%0Aon%3A%0A%20%20push%3A%0A%20%20%20%20branches%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20main%0A%20%20pull_request%3A%0A%20%20%20%20types%3A%20%5Bopened%2C%20synchronize%2C%20reopened%5D%0A%20%20release%3A%0A%20%20%20%20types%3A%20%5Bpublished%5D%0A%0Apermissions%3A%0A%20%20contents%3A%20read%0A%0A%23%20Pull%20request%20numbers%20keep%20cancellation%20queues%20stable%20after%20merge.%20Every%20other%0A%23%20verification%20run%20and%20its%20jobs%20use%20their%20own%20run%20id%3B%20main%20runs%20cannot%20collide.%0A%23%20The%20called%20workflows%20use%20their%20own%20literal%20js-%20and%20rust-%20prefixes.%0Aconcurrency%3A%0A%20%20group%3A%20%24%7B%7B%20github.workflow%20%7D%7D-%24%7B%7B%20github.event_name%20%3D%3D%20%27pull_request%27%20%26%26%20format%28%27pull-%7B0%7D%27%2C%20github.event.pull_request.number%29%20%7C%7C%20github.run_id%20%7D%7D%0A%20%20cancel-in-progress%3A%20true%0A%0Ajobs%3A%0A%20%20%23%20The%20Rust%20workflow%20used%20to%20run%20only%20for%20the%20paths%20below%3B%20a%20change%20outsi